From: Konstantinos Pitas <cwstas2007@hotmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] harbor_agent: Harbor 0.25.0 job creation, agent options and exec user

Port of swiss-ai/nemo-gym 005ecbd6. Harbor 0.25.0 builds a Job through the async Job.create()
(the constructor now raises), validates agent kwargs against options_model with extra=forbid
(so Terminus2NemoGymOptions declares responses_create_params and nemo_model_server_timeout_sec),
and passes a per-command user to exec (root for the tmux install, hooks and verification).
